---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Quddusia Azam grew up in Doranda, Ranchi, taught English for three decades, and now writes and paints."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <hr class="rule" />
  <section class="block">
    <p>
      Quddusia Azam lives in Ranchi, Jharkhand. She grew up in the family house at Bazaar Mohallah, Doranda. Her
      grandfather, Md. Yaqub, had the children sent to a convent school.
    </p>
    <p>
      She taught English from 1992 for three decades. The first children were a prep class. Most of the years were
      classes 3, 4, and 5, and she taught up to class 10. She holds a B.Ed. and an M.A. She has recently retired from
      school.       She has written about the classroom in <a href="/writing/the-last-two-days">The last two days</a>, and
      about the house in <a href="/writing/bazaar-mohallah">Bazaar Mohallah</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      She writes in English, and she paints. From Ranchi she travels through India, and to Canada and the United
      Kingdom, to visit family.
    </p>
    <p>Azam Mam is the name on the door: her surname, and Mam, as her students address a teacher. This site is her desk.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <h2>Write to her</h2>
    <p>
      Write to her at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or find her on
      <a href={site.facebook}>Facebook</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
